Error [jet.MustUseIgnored]: `ScopeGuard` must be used — it was dropped as a bare statement
  --> tests/ui/scope_guard_discarded.jet:4:11
    |
  4 |     scope.guard(fn() { print("cleanup") })
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: A `#MustUse` result carries work or a resource that is lost when nothing checks it
 Fix: Bind it (`n: …`) and use it, or discard it on purpose with `.drop("reason")`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0419
